  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey side extension, by virtue of its prominent location, design, appearance, and positioning in a prominent location would create a dominating addition detracting from the current character of the streetscene which would incur significant&amp;nbsp;harm to the local character of the area. The proposed extension would therefore fail to comply with Policy 56 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024) and Policy D1 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;The proposed two-storey side and rear wrap extension, by virtue of its bulk, depth and wrap-round element with an insufficient separation from the boundary, would create a visually dominant structure which incur overbearing sense of enclosure and poor outlook to the occupiers of No.1 Salters Road, to the contrary of Policy 59 of Waltham Forest LP1 (2024) and Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
